<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Recovery Support | DailyBreath</title><?=dailybreath_web_head('Recovery Support | DailyBreath')?><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;min-height:100vh;color:#eef6ef;background:linear-gradient(#07190fc9,#07190ff2),url('../assets/dailybreath-login-background.webp') center/cover fixed;font:16px/1.65 Inter,system-ui}.shell{width:min(780px,calc(100% - 32px));margin:auto;padding:44px 0 100px}.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between}.top a,.card a{color:#f0cb77}.hero{margin:42px 0}.hero h1{font:clamp(44px,8vw,70px) Georgia,serif;line-height:1;margin:8px 0}.hero p{color:#c1d0c5}.card{margin:14px 0;padding:24px;border:1px solid #ffffff2c;border-radius:22px;background:#123b2ac7}.urgent{border-color:#f0cb7770;background:#4a351bc9}.btn{display:inline-flex;margin:6px 8px 6px 0;padding:11px 15px;border-radius:999px;color:#173f2c!important;background:#f0cb77;text-decoration:none;font-weight:900}.disclaimer{color:#b8c7bc;font-size:13px}</style></head><body><main class="shell"><header class="top"><strong>DailyBreath · Recovery Support</strong><a href="index.php">Home →</a></header><section class="hero"><small>YOU DO NOT HAVE TO CARRY THIS ALONE</small><h1>Support for the next right step.</h1><p>Pause, breathe, and reach toward a trusted person or qualified professional. Asking for help is an act of courage.</p></section><section class="card urgent"><h2>Immediate support in the United States</h2><p>If you may hurt yourself or someone else, call emergency services now. For free, confidential crisis support, call or text <strong>988</strong>.</p><a class="btn" href="tel:988">Call 988</a><a class="btn" href="sms:988">Text 988</a><a href="https://988lifeline.org/get-help/" rel="noopener">Learn about 988 →</a></section><section class="card"><h2>Find treatment and recovery care</h2><p>SAMHSA provides official treatment locators and a national helpline in English and Spanish.</p><a class="btn" href="tel:18006624357">Call 1-800-662-HELP</a><a href="https://www.samhsa.gov/find-help/locators" rel="noopener">Find treatment services →</a></section><section class="card"><h2>A small plan for this moment</h2><ol><li>Move away from anything that could make the situation less safe.</li><li>Tell one trusted person clearly what you need.</li><li>Use professional or crisis support when cravings or distress feel difficult to manage.</li></ol></section><p class="disclaimer">DailyBreath provides faith-centered wellness reflections and general recovery encouragement. It is not medical care, diagnosis, treatment, or emergency service, and it should not replace advice from a qualified professional. Resources above are U.S.-based; use your local emergency or crisis service elsewhere.</p></main><?=dailybreath_web_scripts()?><script src="/assets/js/visitor-analytics.js" defer></script></body></html>
